      <h2>This Archive</h2>
	  <br>
      <p>
        The <strong>CIESIN Map Archive</strong> is a searchable digital archive of high-resolution maps
        authored and maintained by the <a href="https://www.ciesin.columbia.edu/">Center for International
        Earth Science Information Network (CIESIN)</a> at Columbia University.
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>
        This archive is a work in progress; Version 1.0 will include a limited set of maps of the Democratic Republic of the Congo produced between late 2024 and early 2026 as part of the GRID3 project's collaboration with Gavi, the Vaccine Alliance's Equity Accelerator Fund (EAF).
